(7479163, 1188846, 12611, '<td valign="top">I really like the "patina" that appears to be over the whole shot. Gives the photograph an aged feel without doing it overtly. I also like the fact that the camera position has created the illusion that the girl''s arms, hands and feet are bigger than should be proportionately- like sculptures of old.</td>', 'I really like the "patina" that appears to be over the whole shot. Gives the photograph an aged feel without doing it overtly. I also like the fact that the camera position has created the illusion that the girl''s arms, hands and feet are bigger than should be proportionately- like sculptures of old.', '2016-10-22 10:22:30.000000', NULL, 0),
