(7479173, 1189121, 12611, '<td valign="top">Really nice lingering feel- this is one where the viewer needs to allow the eyes to lose focus, to see with the brain. the figure in the back, aware of the scene and menacing the participants, or, as is so often in life, a non-essential player as inanimate as the landscape itself...</td>', 'Really nice lingering feel- this is one where the viewer needs to allow the eyes to lose focus, to see with the brain. the figure in the back, aware of the scene and menacing the participants, or, as is so often in life, a non-essential player as inanimate as the landscape itself...', '2016-10-22 10:38:29.000000', NULL, 0),
