(7479177, 1188998, 12611, '<td valign="top">The underlying quality may be an issue here.Seems a bit brittle, and it might be nice to see a bit more space around the face, but in general I like the colors, mood and composition, and I think there is merit in this shot for the illustration/design aspect. Perhaps even going further into a "Prisma app" type effect would be nice as well.</td>', 'The underlying quality may be an issue here.Seems a bit brittle, and it might be nice to see a bit more space around the face, but in general I like the colors, mood and composition, and I think there is merit in this shot for the illustration/design aspect. Perhaps even going further into a "Prisma app" type effect would be nice as well.', '2016-10-22 10:51:59.000000', NULL, 0),
