(7480755, 1188203, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition, and the grainy high-contrast editing perfectly suits the subject matter. I didn''t vote but would probably have given it a 7 or 8 ...</td>', 'Nice idea and composition, and the grainy high-contrast editing perfectly suits the subject matter. I didn''t vote but would probably have given it a 7 or 8 ...', '2016-11-03 22:19:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7480811, 1188203, 97225, '<td valign="top">Anita I gave you a 6 for this. There are things that I really like - composition, sky, general concept. But there are also things that I don''t. The graininess of the sky doesn''t seem to be compatible with the stark contrasts of the rest of it and there are some harsh halos.  (Btw, I think a certain comment about the horizon was ridiculous.)</td>', 'Anita I gave you a 6 for this. There are things that I really like - composition, sky, general concept. But there are also things that I don''t. The graininess of the sky doesn''t seem to be compatible with the stark contrasts of the rest of it and there are some harsh halos.  (Btw, I think a certain comment about the horizon was ridiculous.)', '2016-11-04 00:25:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7480874, 1188203, 113156, '<td valign="top">Things I like abou this image: nearly everything. Things that could be improved: the subject isn''t that interesting but I''m guessing  you could do nothing about that. Overall a very nice image that should have done better.<br/>Edited because I''m guessing not gushing. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-11-04 08:36:33.</i></td>', 'Things I like abou this image: nearly everything. Things that could be improved: the subject isn''t that interesting but I''m guessing  you could do nothing about that. Overall a very nice image that should have done better.Edited because I''m guessing not gushing. ', '2016-11-04 02:04:06.000000', '2016-11-04 08:36:33.000000', 0),
(7480895, 1188203, 63398, '<td valign="top">Anita, I cannot see why this didn''t do better. On initial view, I wasn''t sure I liked the graininess, but after simply staring at it a while, I can''t imagine it without it. it adds to the raw feel of this mountaintop moment of nature in all her glory. Severely underrated IMNSHO.</td>', 'Anita, I cannot see why this didn''t do better. On initial view, I wasn''t sure I liked the graininess, but after simply staring at it a while, I can''t imagine it without it. it adds to the raw feel of this mountaintop moment of nature in all her glory. Severely underrated IMNSHO.', '2016-11-04 07:24:58.000000', NULL, 0),
