(7482260, 1188847, 98565, '<td valign="top">I remembered that I recognized him as the guitar player when I was voting but that didn''t bother me at all. It is perfectly valid to use a good picture that was created for a certain challenge in a Free Study. I can''t understand why anybody should give a 2, 3 or 4... oh well - we''ll never know... <br/>I rated this picture a 7 but I would have given an 8, if the shadows under his feet weren''t somewhat harsh. <br/> <br/>And I have to tell you a funny story as an aside:<br/>When I was voting on the miniworld (your son playing guitar) our daughter was looking over my shoulder. When she saw you son she said: Well, if this handsome guy asked me for a date I certainly wouldn''t decline!!!</td>', 'I remembered that I recognized him as the guitar player when I was voting but that didn''t bother me at all. It is perfectly valid to use a good picture that was created for a certain challenge in a Free Study. I can''t understand why anybody should give a 2, 3 or 4... oh well - we''ll never know... I rated this picture a 7 but I would have given an 8, if the shadows under his feet weren''t somewhat harsh.  And I have to tell you a funny story as an aside:When I was voting on the miniworld (your son playing guitar) our daughter was looking over my shoulder. When she saw you son she said: Well, if this handsome guy asked me for a date I certainly wouldn''t decline!!!', '2016-11-13 08:35:54.000000', NULL, 0),
